# AgentPlan

## Zero Translation (канон)

См. **`main.mdc`**: Zero Translation Layers, End-to-End Type Safety, Deep Contract Refactoring.
Запрещены промежуточные mappers/adapters/glue/compat-слои и дубли моделей. При рефакторинге меняй контракты end-to-end, не минимизируй blast radius заплатами.

Structured flat checklist for multi-step `llm_node` runs. **Not** WorkItem, **not** `reason.plan` prose.

## Model

- `core/agent_plan/models.py`: `AgentPlan`, `AgentPlanStep`, `AgentPlanStepStatus`
- Storage: **`ExecutionState.agent_plan: AgentPlan | None`** (system / frozen field; tools may overwrite)
- Ids: `agent_plan_id`, `step_id` (tool args use `id` → mapped to `step_id`)
- Statuses: `pending` | `in_progress` | `completed` | `need_help` | `failed` (at most one `in_progress`)

## Tools

| Tool | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `agent_plan_write` | Full replace of `state.agent_plan` from `steps[]`; returns `{ agent_plan_id, plan, blocks: [{ type: agent_plan, plan }] }` |
| `agent_plan_get` | Read current plan; `raise` if missing |

No merge/patch. No `agent_plan_id` in LLM args (server keeps id across overwrites).

Builtin specs: `apps/flows/tools/agent_plan_tools.py` + `builtin_specs.py`.

## Skill

Seed: `apps/flows/bundles/_seed/agent_skills/agent-planning/` (`tool_refs`: write + get).  
Child of `platform-workspace`. Attach/load on any `llm_node` — do **not** put write/get in standing tools by default.

## UI

- Core: `<platform-agent-plan .plan=${...}>` (`core/frontend/static/lib/components/platform-agent-plan.js`)
- Flow UI catalog: AgentPlan surface/component renders the same core host
- i18n: `platform.agent_plan.*` (ru/en)

## Boundaries

| Use AgentPlan | Use WorkItem |
|---|---|
| Micro-steps of a run | Durable assignable work / HITL / boards |

Worktracker detail embed / promote — future bridge; do not store plan as WorkItem rows.
